{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36666","headline":"徐寇南逼感事献江南知己次韵 · 罗隐","name":"徐寇南逼感事献江南知己次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"酒阑离思浩无穷，西望维扬忆数公。\n万里飘零身未了，一家知奖意曾同。\n云横晋国尘应暗，路转吴江信不通。\n今日便成卢子谅，满襟珠泪堕霜风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36666.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36666","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}